SUMMARY
======================================================================
  LEM (universal freeness): Aut acts FREELY on directed Ham PATHS;
  |Aut| | H verified for ALL 1024 labeled n=5 and ALL 32768 labeled
  n=6 tournaments; orbit sizes == |Aut| verified explicitly for every
  tournament with |Aut|>1 at n=5,6 plus 100 random n=6 masks.
  CYCLE caveat confirmed: C3 has 1 Ham cycle, |Aut|=3, 3 does not
  divide 1 (rotation fixes the cycle). Paths are order-rigid; cycles
  are not. Zero Paley/QR/Eisenstein content anywhere in the proof.
  Total runtime: 4.6s
